HookMod_MM.dll -- HookMod ("Hook Mod v5"), reconstructed from the shipped DLL, with HAVOC9 changes
===================================================================================================

What this is
------------

HookMod_MM.dll is built from a clean, recompilable C++ reconstruction of the abandoned "Hook Mod v5"
(Drunken_F00l / Tony Paloma, adminop.net), a grappling hook that shipped only as a Windows binary with
no source. It was reverse-engineered into EntMod4/src/HookMod/ and is a Metamod-R plugin for The
Specialists on the H9XASH engine. This file is the Windows build; HookMod_i386.so is the Linux build of
the same source, new to HAVOC9 (none shipped originally).

Deployed file : addons/HookMod/dlls/HookMod_MM.dll
Built by      : EntMod4/src/build-windows.ps1 (MSBuild, Win32, Release, PlatformToolset v143)
                -> EntMod4/dist/HookMod_MM.dll, deployed to H9XASH/ts/addons/HookMod/dlls.
Size          : 129024 bytes
